 10^(1 - writePrecision)'; ${term#*: }; ${closure#*: }" \
    eval 'grep -q "^End" "$BOXASC/log" && [ $status -eq 0 ] \
      && [[ "$term" == OK* ]] \
      && grep -q "changes the inventory by .* more than 10^(1 - writePrecision)" "$BOXASC/log" \
      && grep -q "gas: Y_PbI2_g written in ascii; deposits: uniform/phaseChange/phaseChangeDeposits; rounded), booked as restart" "$BOXASC/log"'

  restartCopy "$BOX" "$BOXNOSTATE" 0.02
  rm -f "$BOXNOSTATE/0.02/mw_PbI2_s" \
    "$BOXNOSTATE/0.02/uniform/phaseChange/phaseChangeDeposits"
  expectFatal M2.5i "restart directory with uniform/phaseChangeBalance but\
 neither uniform/phaseChange/phaseChangeDeposits nor mw_PbI2_s" "$BOXNOSTATE" \
    "but neither uniform/phaseChange/phaseChangeDeposits of these interface elements nor all of the deposit fields"
else
  result M2.5h FAIL "closed box did not run ($BOX/log)"
  result M2.5i FAIL "closed box did not run ($BOX/log)"
fi


